	<h1 class="font-bold text-4xl md:text-6xl mb-10 text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p class="italic text-balance text-white">It's very short, I promise.</p>
	<hr class="my-5 md:my-10 text-neutral-700"/>
	<p>BookHeaven doesn't engage in ad targeting, data mining or any other activity that might compromise your privacy.</p>
	<p>The data that the apps collect to provide functionality is your own and never leaves your devices.</p>
	<p>Therefore, no data is shared with me or any third party at all, not even for development or statistic purposes, without specific permission.</p>
</CenteredPage>
